  "statement": "For the hash-pinned A1 production coefficients and A10-A13 strict sharp cubes, all prior A13 reductions remain binding at T4. R-082 rewrites the entire FAR wedge as one stopped-current square, closes the uncontrolled production FAR subbranch, and gives the global Pauli--Fierz current coordinate. R-083 now closes all three controlled polynomial J_A FAR rows in that complete stopped object for C>=3, with both endpoints and both predictable drifts retained. In the fixed root-preserving coordinate, controlled CFAR reduces exactly to three Cartan input-scale telescopes with coefficient 3/(80P). The canonical K_k smoothing pays the input coordinate once but does not imply the global raw-output pairwise orthogonality required by the sufficient R-082 Carleson lemma; an exact production-floor-rescaled harmonic fixture records this method no-go without excluding far-only or correlated martingale estimates. The three linear Pauli--Fierz rows have exact Gram, heat, secant, covariance-defect, and nine-block forest algebra, but an adapted heat-lifted fixture with zero rational row has negative linear-row zero chaos. Controlled Cartan CFAR, the recombined complete signed NEAR lower bound, overlap-stable progression, controlled-shell one-use, and q=10/9 Nelson remain open.",
